Resistant non linear smoother. Version 1.0 for Stata 3.0       [STB-7: sed7]
	Version 2.0 for Stata 3.0			    [STB-11: sed7.2]
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
             
	^sm4253eh^ datavar smthvar


Description
-----------

^sm4253eh^ smoothes datavar to produce smthvar.  dtavar is dropped.  The variable
^timendx^ is created to serve as an index for graphing.


Example
-------

 . ^sm4253eh raw smooth^
 . ^graph smooth timendx^


References
----------

Salgado-Ugarte, I. H., & J. Curts-García (1992) sed7: Resistant smoothing using 
         Stata. Stata Technical Bulletin 7: 8–11. Reimpreso en Stata Technical 
	 Bulletin Reprints, vol. 2, pp. 99–103. College Station, TX: Stata Press.
Salgado-Ugarte, I.H. & J. Curts-García (1993) sed7.2: Twice reroughing 
         procedure for resistant nonlinear smoothing. Stata Technical Bulletin 
	 11: 14–16. Reimpreso en Stata Technical Bulletin Reprints, vol. 2, 
	 pp. 108–111. College Station, TX: Stata Press.


